message: "If you use Analytical in research or teaching, please cite this software and the primary scientific sources used in your model."
type: software
title: "Analytical: Physics-first development and validation of mechanistic models"
abstract: "A Codex skill and standalone workflow for developing, auditing, falsifying, and validating physics-based analytical and reduced-order mechanistic models, with emphasis on thermal fluids, phase change, boiling, and critical heat flux."
authors:
